cklog triage T4: green macOS master CI and CPU-work Live Preview [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]gates[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Make bob-cli's macos-latest master test job green so the release [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]train can ship again, then stop the two most-corroborated [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]bob-plugins wall-clock flakes, and continue the five-task backlog [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]chain.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]backlog_triage_t4.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/backlog_triage_t4.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/backlog_triage_t3.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-n7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-n7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make case-sensitive collision tests portable to macOS[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]macos-case[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]macos-case: Resolve bob-cli-l9 (album, record, and highlights-scan [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]collision tests that assume a case-sensitive filesystem) without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]weakening any collision protection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the macOS /var symlink path failures in note catalog and [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]note goto[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]macos-symlink[dim] · [dim][/dim]after macos-case[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]macos-symlink: Resolve bob-cli-n6 (note_catalog xlib tier and note_goto [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault_root under the /var -> /private/var temp symlink), fixing product [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonicalization where it is a real bug.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the detached-grandchild pipe-drain tests deterministic [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and portable[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]pipe-drain[dim] · [dim][/dim]after macos-symlink[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pipe-drain: Resolve bob-cli-kl so both subprocess_runner pipe-drain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests pass deterministically on Linux under full-suite load and on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]macOS, which has no setsid(1).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate the 200-link Live Preview budgets on CPU work[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cpu-gates[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pipe-drain[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cpu-gates: Resolve bob-cli-ju (off-clock link chips, 35 ms) and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-ki (keep-moving marks surface, 250 ms) by measuring CPU work [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the convention bob-cli-3w established, with unchanged budgets and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]workloads.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-n7","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-n7.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-n7.1"},"source_run_id":"run-53ff28fe5d0bea2a4965689c5fe502e5","started_at":"2026-11-18T06:57:41.439094+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"1df0fe404d15889e3d61f8407f84e0d72dbea4c12950bf8c23d9eb2be061dea3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-n7.1--mo